/**
 * @defgroup engine Engine
 * @brief The whole of FASTENgine — the root group every module group belongs to.
 * @details The group tree mirrors the building-block view of the architecture
 *          documentation (Section 5 of docs/arc42). One group per level-1 or
 *          level-2 building block; this file is the only place the module tree
 *          is listed. Conventions: .agents/rules/docs.md.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup engine_algorithms Algorithms
 * @ingroup engine
 * @brief Algorithm implementations (src/algorithms).
 * @details Self-contained algorithms over the core types; no I/O, no global
 *          state. Filled in together with the first sources under src/algorithms.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup engine_patterns Patterns
 * @ingroup engine
 * @brief Static-polymorphism machinery (src/patterns), per style/patterns.md.
 * @details The project's patterns forbid exceptions and virtual functions;
 *          this group carries their static replacements.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup engine_types Core types
 * @ingroup engine
 * @brief Fundamental value types and vocabulary of the engine (src/types).
 * @details Types every other module speaks in; the naming rules of
 *          style/naming.md bind here first.
 */
